:root {
  --ink: #1b1023;
  --ink-soft: #2a1a35;
  --cream: #fff1d0;
  --cream-dim: #e8cda6;
  --orange: #ff7a3d;
  --orange-deep: #ef4a2e;
  --gold: #ffc857;
  --mint: #4df0c1;
  --danger: #ff3b5c;
  --panel: rgba(26, 15, 35, 0.9);
  --panel-soft: rgba(37, 22, 47, 0.78);
  --line: rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.16);
  --display: "Arial Black", "Arial Bold", Impact, "Haettenschweiler", sans-serif;
  --body: "Trebuchet MS", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --mono: "Courier New", ui-monospace, monospace;
  --bike: #ef4a2e;
  --bike-2: #ff8a3d;
  --safe-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  --safe-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html, body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  height: 100%;
  background: #1b1023;
  color: var(--cream);
  font-family: var(--body);
  overflow: hidden;
  overscroll-behavior: none;
}

body {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

button {
  font: inherit;
  color: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

.shell {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  height: 100dvh;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #2a1633;
  touch-action: none;
}

#game {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
  touch-action: none;
}

.screen-fx {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 5;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 44%, transparent 42%, rgba(20, 8, 28, 0.34) 100%),
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.012) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px);
  mix-blend-mode: multiply;
}

/* ============================================================
   HUD
   ============================================================ */
.hud {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 20;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: calc(var(--safe-top) + 12px) clamp(12px, 2.6vw, 30px) 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(-7px);
  transition: opacity 0.24s ease, transform 0.24s ease;
}

.shell.mode-playing .hud,
.shell.mode-crashing .hud {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: none;
}

.hud-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; min-width: 0; }
.hud-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; }

.brand {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 2.5px;
  color: var(--cream-dim);
  opacity: 0.82;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.brand span { color: var(--orange); margin-left: 4px; }

.scorebox { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
.micro-label {
  font-family: var(--body);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 1.7px;
  color: var(--cream-dim);
  opacity: 0.85;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.scorebox strong {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 46px);
  line-height: 0.95;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  color: var(--cream);
  text-shadow: 0 3px 0 rgba(20, 8, 28, 0.5), 0 0 22px rgba(255, 122, 61, 0.25);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.bestbox {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(24, 13, 32, 0.5);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
}
.bestbox strong {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.bike-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 7px 10px 7px 8px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(45, 27, 57, 0.95), rgba(25, 14, 35, 0.95));
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.24);
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 0 rgba(13, 6, 18, 0.55), 0 10px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28);
  text-align: left;
  transition: transform 0.12s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.12s ease;
}
.bike-btn:hover { border-color: var(--bike-2); transform: translateY(-1px); }
.bike-btn:active { transform: translateY(3px); box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(13, 6, 18, 0.55); }
.bike-btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--mint); outline-offset: 3px; }

.bike-swatch {
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  flex: 0 0 34px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, #fff6, transparent 36%), linear-gradient(140deg, var(--bike-2), var(--bike) 62%);
  border: 2px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.8);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 3px rgba(20, 8, 28, 0.3);
}
.bike-btn-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; min-width: 0; }
.bike-btn-copy .micro-label { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; }
.bike-btn-copy strong {
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(12px, 1.35vw, 16px);
  letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  color: var(--cream);
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  max-width: 148px;
}
.swap-glyph {
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--bike-2);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}
.bike-btn:hover .swap-glyph { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.keycap {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0 4px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.4);
  border-radius: 3px;
  font-size: 8px;
  line-height: 1.4;
  margin-left: 2px;
  color: var(--cream);
}

/* Wheelie chip */
.wheelie-chip {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 18;
  top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 78px);
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -8px);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 7px 14px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(77, 240, 193, 0.45);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(20, 12, 28, 0.68);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(77, 240, 193, 0.15);
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.wheelie-chip.show { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }
.wheelie-chip.sweet { border-color: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.28); }
.wheelie-chip.danger { border-color: var(--danger); box-shadow: 0 0 34px rgba(255, 59, 92, 0.4); animation: dangerPulse 0.55s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
.wheelie-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mint); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--mint); }
.wheelie-chip.sweet .wheelie-dot { background: var(--gold); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--gold); }
.wheelie-chip.danger .wheelie-dot { background: var(--danger); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--danger); }
.wheelie-label { color: var(--cream-dim); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; }
#wheelieTime { color: var(--cream); font-size: 14px; }
.wheelie-mult { color: var(--orange); font-weight: 700; }

@keyframes dangerPulse {
  from { transform: translate(-50%, 0) scale(1); }
  to { transform: translate(-50%, 0) scale(1.035); }
}

/* Balance gauge */
.gauge {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 17;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 18px);
  width: min(390px, 40vw);
  transform: translate(-50%, 10px);
  padding: 9px 13px 7px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.18);
  border-radius: 13px;
  background: rgba(24, 13, 32, 0.64);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;
}
.shell.mode-playing .gauge,
.shell.mode-crashing .gauge { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }

.gauge-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
#angleRead { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; color: var(--mint); min-width: 44px; }
.gauge-title { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 2.4px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--cream-dim); opacity: 0.8; }
#speedRead { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--cream-dim); min-width: 58px; text-align: right; }

.gauge-track {
  position: relative;
  height: 12px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  background: #170d1e;
  box-shadow: inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}
.gauge-sweet {
  position: absolute;
  left: 46.5%;
  width: 21%;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 2;
  background: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.16);
  border-left: 1px dashed rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.65);
  border-right: 1px dashed rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.65);
}
.gauge-danger {
  position: absolute;
  left: 78%;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 2;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 59, 92, 0.3) 0 5px, rgba(255, 59, 92, 0.1) 5px 10px);
}
.gauge-fill {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 0%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--mint), var(--gold) 58%, var(--orange) 80%, var(--danger));
  opacity: 0.55;
  transition: width 0.06s linear;
}
.gauge-needle {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 3;
  top: -4px;
  bottom: -4px;
  left: 0;
  width: 3px;
  margin-left: -1.5px;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 2px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 6px #fff, 0 0 12px var(--orange);
  transition: left 0.06s linear;
}
.gauge.danger { animation: gaugeDanger 0.42s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
@keyframes gaugeDanger {
  from { box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(255, 59, 92, 0); }
  to { box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 59, 92, 0.5); }
}
.gauge-foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 7px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.2px; color: var(--cream-dim); opacity: 0.7; }
.sweet-label { color: var(--gold); opacity: 0.9; }

/* ============================================================
   CONTROLS
   ============================================================ */
.controls {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 22;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 12px);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-end;
  padding: 0 clamp(12px, 2.8vw, 34px);
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(12px);
  transition: opacity 0.22s ease, transform 0.22s ease;
}
.shell.mode-playing .controls,
.shell.mode-crashing .controls { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

.control-cluster { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 8px; pointer-events: none; }

.ctrl {
  pointer-events: auto;
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 3px;
  width: clamp(62px, 7vw, 86px);
  height: clamp(58px, 7vw, 76px);
  padding: 6px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.26);
  background: linear-gradient(155deg, rgba(52, 33, 64, 0.88), rgba(25, 14, 35, 0.92));
  color: var(--cream);
  box-shadow: 0 5px 0 rgba(13, 6, 18, 0.55), 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
  touch-action: none;
  transition: transform 0.07s ease, background 0.1s ease, box-shadow 0.07s ease, border-color 0.1s;
}
.ctrl:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--mint); outline-offset: 3px; }
.ctrl.is-active,
.ctrl:active {
  transform: translateY(5px);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(13, 6, 18, 0.55), inset 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
}
.ctrl-name { font-family: var(--display); font-size: clamp(9px, 1.15vw, 12px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-align: center; }
.ctrl-key {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  color: rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.55);
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.ctrl-wide { width: clamp(70px, 8.2vw, 100px); }

.ctrl-gas {
  width: clamp(82px, 9.5vw, 112px);
  height: clamp(78px, 9.4vw, 102px);
  border-radius: 22px;
  border-color: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.65);
  background: linear-gradient(155deg, #ffb43d, var(--orange-deep) 86%);
  color: #2a1010;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #9c2b1d, 0 12px 30px rgba(239, 74, 46, 0.28);
}
.ctrl-gas .ctrl-key { color: rgba(42, 16, 16, 0.62); }
.ctrl-gas .ctrl-name { font-size: clamp(15px, 1.9vw, 21px); }
.ctrl-gas.is-active,
.ctrl-gas:active {
  box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #9c2b1d, inset 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  background: linear-gradient(155deg, #ff9d2e, #d83a20 86%);
}
.ctrl-gas::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 5px;
  border-radius: 17px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.ctrl-brake { border-color: rgba(255, 59, 92, 0.45); }
.ctrl-brake.is-active, .ctrl-brake:active { background: linear-gradient(155deg, #7e2438, rgba(40, 14, 28, 0.95)); }

/* Mute */
.mute-btn {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 40;
  top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 10px);
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  padding: 5px 9px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.2);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(24, 13, 32, 0.55);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  opacity: 0.66;
  transition: opacity 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  font-size: 11px;
}
.mute-btn:hover, .mute-btn:focus-visible { opacity: 1; border-color: var(--gold); outline: none; }
.mute-label { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: var(--cream-dim); }
.mute-btn.muted { opacity: 0.4; }

/* ============================================================
   SCREENS / MENU
   ============================================================ */
.screen {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 30;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: max(16px, calc(var(--safe-top) + 12px)) 14px max(16px, calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 12px));
  opacity: 1;
  visibility: visible;
  transition: opacity 0.24s ease, transform 0.24s ease, visibility 0.24s;
}
.screen.hidden {
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  pointer-events: none;
  transform: translateY(12px);
}

.menu { align-items: center; }
.menu::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 58%, rgba(16, 7, 24, 0.18), rgba(16, 7, 24, 0.72));
  pointer-events: none;
}

.menu-card {
  position: relative;
  width: min(660px, 100%);
  max-height: calc(100dvh - max(32px, var(--safe-top) + var(--safe-bottom) + 28px));
  overflow: auto;
  scrollbar-width: none;
  padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 30px) clamp(18px, 3.4vw, 34px) clamp(15px, 2.2vw, 22px);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.22);
  border-radius: 20px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(44, 26, 55, 0.95), rgba(20, 11, 28, 0.96) 72%),
    var(--panel);
  box-shadow: 0 26px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  animation: cardIn 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.25, 1.1) both;
}
.menu-card::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.menu-card::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0 auto auto 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 5px;
  border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bike), var(--gold) 45%, var(--orange));
}
@keyframes cardIn {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.98); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
}

.kicker {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 2.1px;
  color: var(--orange);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.live-dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--orange);
  box-shadow: 0 0 9px var(--orange);
  animation: blink 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0.35; } }
.kicker.danger { color: var(--danger); }
.kicker.danger .live-dot { background: var(--danger); box-shadow: 0 0 9px var(--danger); }

h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(46px, 8.4vw, 84px);
  font-weight: 900;
  line-height: 0.86;
  letter-spacing: clamp(-4px, -0.35vw, -2px);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cream);
  text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(10, 4, 14, 0.72), 0 0 38px rgba(255, 122, 61, 0.16);
  transform: rotate(-1.2deg);
  transform-origin: left center;
}
h1 em {
  font-style: normal;
  color: var(--orange);
  display: inline-block;
}
.lede {
  margin: 10px 0 15px;
  max-width: 46ch;
  font-size: clamp(11.5px, 1.25vw, 14px);
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--cream-dim);
}
.lede strong { color: var(--cream); }

/* Garage */
.garage {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 32px minmax(0, 1fr) 32px;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.garage-arrow {
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.04);
  color: var(--cream-dim);
  font-size: 23px;
  line-height: 1;
  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
}
.garage-arrow:hover { background: rgba(255, 122, 61, 0.14); color: var(--cream); }
.garage-arrow:active { transform: scale(0.95); }
.garage-arrow:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--mint); outline-offset: 2px; }

.garage-bike {
  padding: 11px 14px 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.14);
  border-radius: 13px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 12% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--bike) 22%, transparent), transparent 55%),
    rgba(10, 5, 15, 0.34);
  min-width: 0;
}
.garage-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; }
.bike-class { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.7px; color: var(--bike-2); }
.bike-number { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; color: var(--cream-dim); opacity: 0.65; }
.garage-bike h2 {
  margin: 2px 0 3px;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(19px, 2.8vw, 27px);
  letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  line-height: 1.05;
  color: var(--cream);
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.bike-tag { margin: 0 0 9px; min-height: 2.4em; font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--cream-dim); opacity: 0.86; }

.stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
.stat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; }
.stat span { font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.3px; color: var(--cream-dim); opacity: 0.75; }
.stat i { display: block; height: 6px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); overflow: hidden; }
.stat b {
  display: block;
  height: 100%;
  width: 60%;
  border-radius: 4px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--bike-2), var(--bike));
  transition: width 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
}

.menu-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 9px;
  min-height: 48px;
  padding: 12px 20px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 2px solid #120915;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(12px, 1.4vw, 15px);
  letter-spacing: 0.8px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: transform 0.08s ease, box-shadow 0.08s ease, filter 0.15s ease;
}
.btn span { font-family: var(--body); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1; }
.btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--mint); outline-offset: 3px; }
.btn-primary {
  flex: 1 1 220px;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bike-2), var(--bike));
  color: #26100c;
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #0d0612, inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32);
}
.btn-primary:hover { filter: brightness(1.07); }
.btn-primary:active { transform: translate(4px, 4px); box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #0d0612; }
.btn-secondary {
  flex: 0 1 auto;
  background: rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.06);
  color: var(--cream);
  box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #0d0612;
}
.btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.12); }
.btn-secondary:active { transform: translate(4px, 4px); box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #0d0612; }

.menu-foot {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 14px;
  padding-top: 11px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.1);
  font-size: 8.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1.1px;
  color: var(--cream-dim);
}
.menu-foot strong { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; color: var(--gold); margin-left: 4px; }
.desktop-hint { font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 400; font-size: 8px; opacity: 0.62; text-align: right; }
.touch-hint { display: none; font-size: 8px; opacity: 0.65; }

/* ============================================================
   GAME OVER
   ============================================================ */
.gameover { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 50%, rgba(20, 7, 26, 0.42), rgba(12, 4, 18, 0.82)); }
.over-card {
  width: min(560px, 100%);
  padding: clamp(20px, 3.4vw, 34px);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 59, 92, 0.4);
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(52, 24, 42, 0.96), rgba(20, 10, 27, 0.97));
  box-shadow: 0 28px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  animation: cardIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.25, 1.08) both;
}
.over-card h2 {
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 68px);
  line-height: 0.9;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  color: var(--danger);
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0d0612;
  transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  transform-origin: left center;
}
.over-reason { margin: 0 0 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--cream-dim); }

.result-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.result {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 3px;
  padding: 9px 11px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.12);
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
  min-width: 0;
}
.result span { font-size: 7.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.2px; color: var(--cream-dim); opacity: 0.75; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.result strong { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; color: var(--cream); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.result.big { grid-row: span 2; justify-content: center; }
.result.big strong { font-size: clamp(32px, 5.4vw, 46px); color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: -2px; }
.result.big span { color: var(--gold); opacity: 1; }

.new-best {
  margin: 0 0 13px;
  padding: 7px 10px;
  border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.55);
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.08);
  color: var(--gold);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 1.7px;
  text-align: center;
  animation: bestPulse 0.9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
}
@keyframes bestPulse { from { box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(255, 200, 87, 0); } to { box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.18); } }
.over-hint { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.6px; color: var(--cream-dim); opacity: 0.55; text-align: center; }

/* Toast */
.toast {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 45;
  left: 50%;
  bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 150px);
  transform: translate(-50%, 12px);
  padding: 9px 16px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 241, 208, 0.28);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: rgba(24, 13, 32, 0.9);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  font-family: var(--display);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.8px;
  color: var(--cream);
  text-align: center;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
  max-width: min(90vw, 520px);
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, 0); }
.toast strong { color: var(--bike-2); }
.toast small { display: block; font-family: var(--body); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .7px; color: var(--cream-dim); margin-top: 2px; }

/* ============================================================
   RESPONSIVE
   ============================================================ */
@media (max-width: 820px) {
  .gauge { width: min(340px, 52vw); bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 14px); }
  .wheelie-chip { top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 74px); }
  .toast { bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 128px); }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .bestbox { display: none; }
  .bike-btn-copy .micro-label { font-size: 7px; }
  .bike-btn-copy strong { max-width: 104px; font-size: 12px; }
  .bike-swatch { width: 29px; height: 29px; flex-basis: 29px; }
  .scorebox strong { font-size: 32px; }
  .brand { font-size: 9px; }
  .hud { padding-top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 9px); }
  .wheelie-chip { font-size: 10px; padding: 6px 11px; top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 66px); }
  .menu-card { border-radius: 17px; }
  .garage { grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr) 28px; gap: 6px; }
  .garage-arrow { border-radius: 8px; font-size: 20px; }
  .menu-actions .btn { flex: 1 1 100%; }
  .menu-actions .btn-secondary { flex: 1 1 100%; }
  .menu-foot { justify-content: center; }
  .desktop-hint { display: none; }
  .touch-hint { display: inline; }
  .result-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr; }
}

/* Portrait phones: stack the gauge above the thumb controls */
@media (max-width: 720px) and (orientation: portrait) {
  .gauge {
    width: min(92vw, 390px);
    bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 176px);
  }
  .controls { padding: 0 10px; bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 10px); }
  .ctrl { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 14px; }
  .ctrl-wide { width: 78px; }
  .ctrl-gas { width: 96px; height: 94px; border-radius: 20px; }
  .ctrl-gas .ctrl-name { font-size: 19px; }
  .control-cluster.lean-cluster { gap: 6px; }
  .control-cluster.drive-cluster { gap: 6px; }
  .toast { bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 186px); }
  .wheelie-chip { top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 58px); }
  .mute-label { display: none; }
  .mute-btn { top: auto; bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 10px); left: 50%; z-index: 25; }
  .shell.mode-playing .mute-btn { opacity: 0.36; }
  .menu-card { padding: 16px 15px 14px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 13vw, 58px); }
  .lede { margin: 8px 0 12px; font-size: 11px; }
  .bike-tag { min-height: 0; font-size: 9.5px; }
  .menu-foot { margin-top: 11px; padding-top: 9px; }
}

@media (max-height: 560px) and (orientation: landscape) {
  .hud { padding-top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 7px); }
  .scorebox strong { font-size: 28px; }
  .brand { display: none; }
  .wheelie-chip { top: calc(var(--safe-top) + 56px); }
  .gauge { width: min(310px, 34vw); bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 10px); padding: 6px 10px 5px; }
  .gauge-head { margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .gauge-foot { display: none; }
  .controls { bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 8px); }
  .ctrl { width: 62px; height: 54px; }
  .ctrl-wide { width: 74px; }
  .ctrl-gas { width: 84px; height: 76px; }
  .ctrl-gas .ctrl-name { font-size: 16px; }
  .menu-card { padding: 14px 20px 12px; border-radius: 15px; }
  h1 { font-size: 42px; }
  .lede { margin: 6px 0 10px; font-size: 11px; }
  .garage { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .garage-bike { padding: 8px 11px; }
  .bike-tag { min-height: 0; margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: 9.5px; }
  .menu-foot { margin-top: 9px; padding-top: 8px; }
  .btn { min-height: 40px; padding: 8px 16px; }
  .over-card { padding: 16px 22px; }
  .over-card h2 { font-size: 40px; }
  .result-grid { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .over-hint { display: none; }
  .toast { bottom: calc(var(--safe-bottom) + 108px); }
}

@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
  .touch-hint { display: none; }
}

/* Keep everything readable with reduced motion */
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after {
    animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
    transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
  }
}

content.text:
Now game.js. This is the big part. Let's plan all functions and ensure correctness.

Globals/DOM refs.
Bikes data.

Colors. Bike style variations.

Canvas setup:
```
const canvas, ctx;
const view = {w:0,h:0,dpr:1,scale:1,groundY:0,bikeX:0}
function resize() {
 const rect = shell.getBoundingClientRect(); 
 view.w=rect.width; view.h=rect.height; view.dpr=Math.min(devicePixelRatio||1,2)
 canvas.width=Math.round(w*dpr); canvas.height=...
 canvas.style...
 ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0)
 compute layout
}
```
Drawing in CSS pixels via transform. Each frame reset transform? `ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0)` at render start.

Layout:
```
const portrait = w < 720 && h > w;
view.scale = clamp(Math.min(w/980, h/680), 0.56, 1.2) * (portrait?1.08:1)
view.groundY = h * (portrait ? 0.67 : 0.735) // but in landscape short h=400 ground 294; controls bottom 100 overlap bike? controls at edges not center.
view.bikeX = w * (portrait ? 0.34 : 0.31)
view.wheelBase = 136*scale
```
Actually bike length ~176*scale. At desktop 1440x900 scale min(1.47,1.32)=>1.2 clamp; bike 211 px. Good. At 1200x700 scale 1.03; bike 181. At mobile 390x844: min(.398,1.24)=.398 clamp .56*1.08=.605; bike 106. okay, maybe larger: .62. Since ground at .67*844=565, bike 106 tall ~70? fine.
At landscape 844x390: min(.861,.574)=.574 clamp .574; bike 101. okay.

Physics:
```
const game = {
 mode: 'menu',
 bikeIndex: 0,
 score:0, best..., run...,
 elapsed:0, menuTime:0,
 shake:0, flash:0,
 crash:...
}
```
Use separate `run` object.

Persistent storage safe wrappers.

Per-bike best object loaded:
```
function loadStore(key, fallback) { try { JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key)) } catch {}}
const savedBests = load('wheelie-rider-bests-v1', {});
```
Ensure values numbers.

`bike best` key id.

State inputs:
```
const keyboard = { gas:false, brake:false, leanBack:false, leanFwd:false };
const pointerInputs = { gas:0, brake:0, leanBack:0, leanFwd:0 }; // counts? use Set of pointer ids per action
const activePointers = new Map(); // pointerId -> action
function inputGas(){ return keyboard.gas || [...activePointers.values()].includes('gas') || ...}
```
Simpler counts object:
```
const touchHeld = {gas:false,...};
function isDown(action){ return keyboard[action] || touchHeld[action]; }
```
But two pointers pressing gas and brake simultaneously works. On pointerdown set true; pointerup set false. If two pointers touch same button, one release would false incorrectly. Rare. Use Set pointerIds per action:
```
const held = new Map(); // pointerId -> action
function actionHeld(action){ for (const a of held.values()) if (a===action) return true; return false; }
```
Iterate small map each frame fine. Keyboard booleans.

Pointer binding:
```
document.querySelectorAll('.ctrl').forEach(btn => {
 const action=btn.dataset.action;
 btn.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => { e.preventDefault(); btn.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); held.set(e.pointerId, action); btn.classList.add('is-active'); ensureAudio(); });
 const release = e => { held.delete(e.pointerId); if(!actionHeld(action)) btn.classList.remove('is-active'); };
 btn.addEventListener('pointerup', release); ... pointercancel, lostpointercapture
});
```
Note pointerleave while captured won't fire until up; okay. Also on `pointerdown` if mode menu, maybe start? No, buttons hidden.

Keyboard:
```
const keyMap = {ArrowUp:'gas', KeyW:'gas', ArrowDown:'brake', KeyS:'brake', ArrowLeft:'leanBack', KeyA:'leanBack', ArrowRight:'leanFwd', KeyD:'leanFwd'};
window.addEventListener('keydown', e=>{ if (e.repeat)...; ensureAudio(); switch e.code...
 Space: if menu start; if over start; prevent
 KeyB: cycleBike(1)
 KeyM: toggleMute
 Escape/KeyP: pause? maybe.
}
```
Prevent default for mapped keys and space. Need not start on gas automatically in menu? Could: if mode menu and gas pressed, start run? Nice. But pressing B should not. Add: if mode menu and (gas/brake/lean) -> startRun? Standard games start with any movement. But could surprise. Let's allow Space/Enter and clicking. Keep.

Pointer buttons have `aria-pressed`? not necessary.

Audio. Implement safely.

```
class AudioEngine {
 constructor() {...}
 ensure(){
  if (this.ctx) { if(this.ctx.state==='suspended') this.ctx.resume(); return; }
  const AC = window.AudioContext...
  ...
 }
 setMuted(m) { ... master.gain.setTargetAtTime }
 setEngine(speed, gas, active) {
  if (!this.ctx) return;
  const t=this.ctx.currentTime;
  const f = 48 + speed*0.42 + gas*16;
  this.o1.frequency.setTargetAtTime(f,t,0.06)
  this.o2.frequency.setTargetAtTime(f*1.51,t,0.06)
  this.filter.frequency.setTargetAtTime(300+speed*2.1+gas*400,t,0.08)
  const vol = active ? 0.035 + gas*0.02 : 0.008
  this.engGain.gain.setTargetAtTime(vol,t,0.08)
 }
 crash(){
  ensure; noise buffer...
  osc thud 90->35 over .4
 }
 click(){...}
}
```
Engine oscillators: create o1 saw, o2 square lower gain, through filter->gain->master. Start. If muted before ctx? ensure creates master gain 0. On unmute set gain.

`muted` persisted. Update button.

Sound only after gesture because ensure called on interactions; game loop calls setEngine but ctx may null; fine.

Scene generation:
Props arrays:
```
const props = [];
let seed=7; function rand(){seed=(seed*1664525+1013904223)>>>0; return seed/4294967296;}
for i 0..40 create ground props {x: i*160+rand*90, type, size, layer}
```
But drawing x with wrap; `worldWidth = 2200`; use speed factor.

Background functions:
- `drawSky(t)` uses view dimensions and game.scroll.
```
const grad = ctx.createLinearGradient(0,0,0,h);
grad.addColorStop(0,'#25154d'); ... '#ff9a62'
```
Can cache gradient on resize; use direct each frame fine.
- Sun at x = w*0.74, y = groundY - h*0.27? radius 54*scale. Add glow with radial gradient. Add horizontal bands over sun (retro). Clip circle then draw stripes sky color.
- clouds: draw with parallax; three cloud shapes using ellipses.
- mountains: path with sine ridge.
  ```
  function ridge(offset, base, amp, color, freq, alpha) {
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0,h);
    for (x=0; x<=w; x+=24) { const y = base - (Math.sin((x+offset)*0.005)*amp + Math.sin((x+offset)*0.013+1.7)*amp*0.35 + amp*0.6); ctx.lineTo(x,y); }
    ctx.lineTo(w,h); close fill
  }
  ```
  Use far layer behind sun? Sun before mountains (sun partly behind). Sky, sun, far mountains, clouds maybe, mid mountains, etc.
- haze gradient near horizon.

Ground:
```
const groundTop = groundY - 8*scale? Ground surface line at groundY.
ctx.fillStyle gradient from #b45a37 to #57281f
fillRect(0, groundY, w, h-groundY)
// texture: horizontal stripes and pebbles
ctx.fillStyle rgba cream .08 draw dashed line at groundY+12
```
Draw track stripe:
```
ctx.fillStyle='rgba(255,190,120,.13)'; fillRect(0,groundY+2,w,10)
```
Props cacti (behind or on ground), stumps, signs. Draw after ground.
Need the bike sits on groundY, rear wheel bottom at groundY. Good.

`drawScenery`:
- Layer 1 far mountains (scroll*0.05) behind.
- Layer 2 mesas (scroll*0.14) with darker.
- layer 3 dunes behind ground at groundY with rolling sine.
- ground.
- props at y groundY: cacti, rocks, signs with scroll factor 1. Use `wrapX = ((p.x - scroll*p.par) % wrap + wrap) % wrap - 80`; but if wrap=2400 and w maybe 1440, only some visible. Fine. Also add a start banner at x near bike that scrolls away.
- speed streaks: draw 8 horizontal lines moving left based on scroll, at random y above ground, alpha speed factor.

World scroll `game.scroll += run.speed * dt * view.scale * 0.75` while playing/crashing; menu idle scroll slow (20*dt).

Bike render should include shadow:
```
